    "ruleCards": [
      {
        "title": "Sidekicks",
        "content": "When an enemy sidekick's health is equal or lower than the half of their starting health, Wanda is able to control them and they are considered friendly fighters. If the opposing fighter recovers health, the sidekicks recover equal health even if the card does not say it. If their health has risen higher than the halfway mark they return to the opponent. One health sidekicks are not controllable by health requirements but they can temporarily be controlled by card effects."
      },
      {
        "title": "Odd Health Sidekicks",
        "content": "If a sidekick has an odd health every time that the sidekick's health cannot be evenly divided, the halfway point is going to be the smallest of the 2 such as 5 health the halfway poinr for the ability is 2 health. For 7 health it is 3 health, etc."
      }
    ]
  }
